    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\" columnspacing=\"1.4ex\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</